  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting School Sector Development Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program will support the School Sector Development Plan (SSDP), which is the government&apos;s major education initiative for FY2017-FY2023. The Asian Development Bank (ADB) and eight other joint financing partners (JFPs) will finance the program with the government during FY2017-FY2021 through a sector-wide approach.</narrative>
  </description>
